DECISIONS={'66a04078':('positive','kernel','Reduce useless NAX dense GEMM work for empty SIMD-group output extents on partial M/N tiles, while preserving supported-device routing, all barriers and aligned-shape behavior','Predicate tile loads and matrix operations on a nonempty row/column extent, keeping threadgroup barriers outside per-group skipped work; also suppress empty epilogues and stores. The benefit is shape and hardware dependent: this is not a license to force NAX on unsupported GPUs or a universal GEMM speedup.')}
